# Anticoagulation Guidelines

Below is a table drafted from combined SOAP consensus Statement as well as ASRA Coags 2.1 

| Drug                    	| Dose                          	| Pre-placement 	| After placement 	| Pre-removal    	| After removal                 	|
|-------------------------	|-------------------------------	|---------------	|-----------------	|----------------	|-------------------------------	|
| SQH                     	| 5000 TID                      	| 4-6h          	| immediate       	| 4-6h           	| immediate                     	|
| SQH - Hi                	| 7500 BID                      	| 12h & aPTT    	| 1h              	| 4-6h           	| immediate                     	|
| LMWH - Lo               	| 40mg QD<br>30mg BID           	| 12h           	| 12h             	| not advised    	| 4h<br>if 12h after placement  	|
| LMWH - Md               	| <1.5mg/kg QD<br><1.0mg/kg BID 	| 12-24h        	| 12-24h          	| not advised    	| 4h AND<br>12h after placement 	|
| LMWH - Hi               	| 1.5mg/kg QD<br>1.0mg/kg BID   	| 24h           	| 24h             	| not advised    	| 4h AND<br>12h after placement 	|
| ASA + SQH<br>ASA + LMWH 	|                               	| 24h           	|                 	| Can resume ASA 	| 24h                           	|

  
